較多一點，吃起來很有飽足感\n\n湯頭的口味還不錯 是少數拉麵店自己吃了不會狂喝水的\n肉的品質也很好 很嫩很好吃\n服務也很客氣有禮",null,[0,55]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12243181635370566383/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPVVdOcE1WZGxiWGhEWkZZNGQySlZTakZaVlVaTFVsZDBSMlZYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12243181635370566383/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPVVdOcE1WZGxiWGhEWkZZNGQySlZTakZaVlVaTFVsZDBSMlZYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12243181635370566383/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPVVdOcE1WZGxiWGhEWkZZNGQySlZTakZaVlVaTFVsZDBSMlZYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12243181635370566383/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPVVdOcE1WZGxiWGhEWkZZNGQySlZTakZaVlVaTFVsZDBSMlZYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12243181635370566383/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPVVdOcE1WZGxiWGhEWkZZNGQySlZTakZaVlVaTFVsZDBSMlZYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12243181635370566383/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPVVdOcE1WZGxiWGhEWkZZNGQySlZTakZaVlVaTFVsZDBSMlZYWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,13873,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOUWNpMVdlbXhDZFY4d2JVSjFZVUZLUld0R2VXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xf569173eb7a06f2d!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkNQci1WemxCdV8wbUJ1YUFKRWtGeWc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOUWNpMVdlbXhDZFY4d2JVSjFZVUZLUld0R2VXYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOUWNpMVdlbXhDZFY4d2JVSjFZVUZLUld0R2VXYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOUWNpMVdlbXhDZFY4d2JVSjFZVUZLUld0R2VXYxILMGNhcjJCQU9pa0EaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rTlFjaTFXZW14Q2RWOHdiVUoxWVVGS1JXdEdlV2MSCzBjYXIyQkFPaWtBIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARLW-gtz4XafUqCzBjYXIyQkFPaWtB\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286